  "body_html": "<h1>Maximin is Bounded by Minimax</h1>\n<p>For every finite matrix game,</p>\n<p>$$\\max_x \\min_j E_A(x,j) \\le \\min_y \\max_i E_A(i,y).$$</p>\n<p>This is the weak-duality inequality: player I's best guaranteed payoff cannot\nexceed player II's best upper bound on player I's payoff.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MFoGT, Chapter 2, Lemmas 2.2.4 and 2.2.8] Laraki, Renault, and Sorin, <em>Mathematical Foundations of Game Theory</em>, <code>references/MechDesign.pdf</code>. The lower value never exceeds the upper value.</li>\n</ul>",
